qWqcTBYboNohoqHbdCdYcCWu00g_EEaZ4cWVA&oe=6B005B9E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CovertArt-Landscape.png", "id": "26817019441240866", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825546_26817019454574198_4337695362179188436_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iAYMQp9nPrYQ7kNvwFLe6D0&_nc_oc=AdrRohfVhzgv__utREPcLaDS96HY95VfvdC_dIpITSx59ukmYcJ6_mfmQHmBTAAjPtQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQMGblbHZtSvGc2PGTWut2Du63-OxUse3yAvfdMFAZRhA&oe=6B007D93"}, "display_name": "AVO: Echoes of the Void", "keywords": ["Space", "VRPuzzle", "ZeroGravity", "Adventure", "AI"], "long_description": "AVO: Echoes of the Void is a story-driven VR puzzle adventure built from the ground up for immersive, hands-on virtual reality.\n\nYour journey begins aboard a failing spacecraft. Moments later, a catastrophic event tears the ship apart, leaving you drifting in the void with no clear answers and no way home.\n\nAwakening inside the wreckage, you must adapt to zero-gravity movement, interact with damaged systems, and explore a mysterious network of interconnected environments. Each space you enter introduces new mechanics, tools, and challenges that build upon one another, encouraging experimentation and mastery rather than one-off solutions.\n\n\nAVO: Echoes of the Void is not just about solving puzzles. It is about surviving in an unfamiliar environment, learning its rules, and uncovering what lies beyond the void.\n", "short_description": "AVO: Echoes of the Void is a direct narrative sequel to AVO Escape Space, continuing the story exactly where it ended.\n\nStranded after a catastrophic space disaster, you awaken inside a shattered spacecraft. Navigate zero gravity, solve immersive VR puzzles, and uncover the mystery hidden within the void.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.avovr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_